<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεῖπον</span></b> , aor. with no
		pres. in use (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαγορεύω</span> (q.
		v.) being used instead): fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					652
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				Pass.
			, v. infr. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>:—<i>say</i> or <i>repeat before</i> another,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγὼ δ᾽ ὑπερῶ τὸν ὅρκον</span>
			l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>say by way of preface, premise, suggest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπειπεῖν τούσδε τοὺς αὐτοὺς λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1171
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγ᾽ ἄτθ᾽ ὑπειπὼν πρῶτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐν ἀρχῇ ὑπείπομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοσοῦτον ὑπειπών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.60
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ὑπειπὼν πῶς</span>
			without <i>suggesting</i> the method, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				23.53
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιοῦτος . . , ὃν ὑπεῖπες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Virt.</u>
					377d
				</span></i>
			; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοὴν ὑπειπών,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προειπών</span>
			 (referring to the words of the proclamation, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκούετε, λεῴ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				962
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθάπερ καὶ ἐξ ἀρχῆς ἦν ὑπειρημένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					11.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>subjoin, add,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπειπούσης . . ὅτι ἐς ἑσπέραν
					ἥξοιμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					997
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.14.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπειπὼν τἆλλα ὅτι αὐτὸς τἀκεῖ
					πράξοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.90
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.102
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἐχθρὸν . . ὑπειπὼν τὸν
				αὑτοῦ</span>
			<i>adding the name of</i> his personal enemy, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.91
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπειπὼν τῆς Ὑγιείας τοῠνομα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philetaer.
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>suggest an explanation, hint, give a clue,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥστ᾽ . . ἂν . . ὑπείποις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					213
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὑτωσί πως ὑπειπόντα τὸ τοῦ Πιττακοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					343e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
